# Reply in English

- Always respond in **English**, regardless of the language the user uses.
- If the user writes in Chinese (or any other language), still answer in English.
- You may quote or reference non-English terms from the user's message when needed for clarity, but explanations, questions, and all assistant prose must be in English.
- Do not switch to Chinese because the user wrote in Chinese.
